","raw":null,"reporter":"Dana (daughter)","channel":"sms","location_text":"1144 Bee Tree Rd, Swannanoa","point":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[-82.41275,35.63187]}},{"id":10,"observed_at":"2024-09-29T12:50:00Z","source_type":"social","category":"NEED","subtype":"transport_need","confidence":0.85,"incident_id":10,"summary":"oxygen user needs ride to shelter in Black Mountain","text":"My aunt on Montreat Rd in Black Mountain uses an oxygen concentrator and the power is still out. Her backup tanks will last till about tonight. She needs a ride to the shelter at the Black Mountain Library where they have generator power. She's stable, not an emergency yet.","raw":null,"reporter":"Black Mountain Neighbors","channel":"facebook","location_text":"Montreat Rd, Black Mountain","point":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[-82.3172,35.6262]}},{"id":9,"observed_at":"2024-09-29T12:30:00Z","source_type":"radio","category":"HAZARD","subtype":"landslide","confidence":0.7,"incident_id":9,"summary":"Unconfirmed slide (hazard \u2192 verification only)","text":"Unit 214, caller advising possible slide across Town Mtn Rd up past the overlook, unknown if passable, caller is second hand, no units free to check.","raw":"Unit 214, caller advising possible slide across Town Mtn Rd up past the overlook, unknown if passable, caller is second hand, no units free to check.","reporter":"BCSO","channel":"BCSO Ops 1","location_text":"Town Mountain Rd past the overlook","point":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[-82.5205,35.6178]}},{"id":8,"observed_at":"2024-09-29T12:20:00Z","source_type":"social","category":"NEED","subtype":"shelter_need","confidence":0.85,"incident_id":8,"summary":"roof hole, elderly man alone in Candler","text":"Reposting for my dad (68, lives alone) on Pisgah Hwy in Candler \u2014 a big oak came down on the back of his house and there's a hole in the roof, rain coming in. He needs a tarp put up, he can't get on a ladder himself. Anyone with a ladder and a strong back?","raw":null,"reporte